  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/taint2/). VERDICT: CURRENT. Review 2026-11-01 at dev 100b6fbb6e: fixture #define DBG(fmt, ...) fprintf(stderr, fmt, __VA_ARGS__) + DBG(\"%s\", getenv(\"PASS\")) emits main -> c:external:0-0:DBG (unfollowed_construct=macro_call) and no fprintf edge; verify-claims reads inconclusive ('macro_call at main.c:7'). Premise correction: after expansion the call reaches fprintf, rowed fs_write (zone host_fs), so the DONE-WHEN host_secret->logging claim would stay confirmed; use host_secret->host_fs or decide stderr-as-logging first. MECHANISM: C analyzer emits a function-like macro call as an unresolved call to the macro name; no body expansion. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-ronuj."  # 0585
